{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13406","headline":"泊震泽口 · 薛据","name":"泊震泽口","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"日落草木阴，舟徒泊江汜。\n苍茫万象开，合沓闻风水。\n洄沿值渔翁，䆗窱逢樵子。\n云开天宇静，月明照万里。\n早鴈湖上飞，晨钟海边起。\n独坐嗟远游，登岸望孤洲。\n零落星欲尽，朣胧气渐收。\n行藏空自秉，智识仍未周。\n伍胥既仗劒，范蠡亦乘流。\n歌竟鼓楫去，三江多客愁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛据","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13406.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13406","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}